---
// ProblemSection.astro - Master Section 01: The Problem card
---

<section class="problem-section" id="the-problem" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem-card-container" data-animate="fade-up">
      <p class="eyebrow">— 01 / THE PROBLEM</p>
      
      <div class="section-top">
        <h2 id="problem-heading">
          A good match asks for more than a shade number.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-description">
          Finding foundation is rarely as simple as choosing between light and dark. Skin tone, undertone, testing conditions and how a formula wears can all shape the experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-columns">
        <article class="problem-col">
          <span class="col-num">01</span>
          <h3>Limited choice.</h3>
          <p>Finding a shade that accounts for your skin tone and undertone can be difficult.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="problem-col">
          <span class="col-num">02</span>
          <h3>Limited testing.</h3>
          <p>Online swatches and store lighting don't always tell you how a shade looks on your own skin.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="problem-col">
          <span class="col-num">03</span>
          <h3>Uncertain wear.</h3>
          <p>A shade that looks right at first may change in appearance as the formula settles and wears.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    padding: 60px 0 70px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .problem-card-container {
    background: var(--warm-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 56px 64px 48px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(27, 5, 22, 0.03);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--wine);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .section-top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 0.75fr);
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .problem-card-container h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.06;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--plum);
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .section-description {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    color: var(--ink-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .problem-columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 36px;
  }

  .problem-col {
    padding-right: 32px;
  }

  .problem-col + .problem-col {
    padding-left: 32px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .col-num {
    display: block;
    color: var(--wine);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .problem-col h3 {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--wine);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }

  .problem-col p {
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-body);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .section-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .problem-card-container {
      padding: 36px 24px;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }
    .problem-columns {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      padding-top: 24px;
    }
    .problem-col {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
    .problem-col + .problem-col {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
